    "alt": "在下雨的早晨，小男孩站在窗邊看著窗外的雨滴，媽媽在玄關微笑提醒，小男孩穿上黃色外套與雨靴並拿著雨傘，準備出門上學。",
    "width": 1536,
    "height": 1024
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Leo looks out the "
        },
        {
          "text": "window",
          "wordIds": [
            "window"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " on a "
        },
        {
          "text": "rainy",
          "wordIds": [
            "rainy"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " morning."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "在下雨的早晨，Leo 看著窗外。",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/weather-clothes/1.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "8e78297abf91c010d8bee469db1959972b03010e50e62dcb99880171fb747446",
        "sha256": "751603ee7e154ff6b1fce02f0ad83f2dc07b4b0ea1c447451672406fa0b43434"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "He looks at the raindrops and says, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "Look, it is raining!",
          "phraseIds": [
            "look-it-is-raining"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "他看著雨滴說：「看，外面下雨了！」",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/weather-clothes/2.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "fd89c9ce9fa4baa5481302a15ee89a9b104748b1b68bbcb25dd8ef320a18757d",
        "sha256": "f55569abd9889f8a5dced75b0bc3e831e28e118560fd4665cb3837292d174993"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "The "
        },
        {
          "text": "weather",
          "wordIds": [
            "weather"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " is cold and wet today."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "今天的天氣又冷又濕。",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/weather-clothes/3.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "046ae8b5dc8c60d6a0f33711f52c7e04b028e55b3f24740b9e99b541767bbe2d",
        "sha256": "6598cb269ad1d79e9b60369e58063845dd76754c2bc5840672f7f5fd73aa06cc"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Leo runs to his room and says, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "I need my ",
          "phraseIds": [
            "i-need-my-jacket"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "jacket",
          "phraseIds": [
            "i-need-my-jacket"
          ],
          "wordIds": [
            "jacket"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "phraseIds": [
            "i-need-my-jacket"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "Leo 跑到房間說：「我需要我的外套。」",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/weather-clothes/4.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "323971c3aebffe8ad730fdee286a3d8a2f89f39505a706616a8c8f4a0cbbc06d",
        "sha256": "68edd51f8d3d0cef4b88d253fd58b049f29bb69dcb1d95c08bacbb569af7d120"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Mom smiles and says, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "Put on your ",
          "phraseIds": [
            "put-on-your-boots"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "boots",
          "phraseIds": [
            "put-on-your-boots"
          ],
          "wordIds": [
            "boots"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "phraseIds": [
            "put-on-your-boots"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "媽媽微笑著說：「穿上你的靴子。」",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/weather-clothes/5.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "8ecc8941455465174428fb8839a287ab27d3a8c011ed4e3495dd756f735591d1",
        "sha256": "5e860ab0f5b76fd90ea3276371b58274e8dbddffdfa29b37d5034df015498129"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Mom points to the door and says, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "Don't forget your ",
          "phraseIds": [
            "dont-forget-your-umbrella"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "umbrella",
          "phraseIds": [
            "dont-forget-your-umbrella"
          ],
          "wordIds": [
            "umbrella"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "phraseIds": [
            "dont-forget-your-umbrella"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "媽媽指著門口說：「別忘了帶你的雨傘。」",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/weather-clothes/6.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "b7a0cf77fb7b0b1f024ee6ffa1dfd81efd15a6ae70aff177db38960adb4bf052",
        "sha256": "9526acdc85e38c1276ef6456e1823f53fc4233773942d0d296582ba2b7f259a4"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Leo takes his "
        },
        {
          "text": "umbrella",
          "wordIds": [
            "umbrella"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " and smiles, ready to go outside."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "Leo 拿著雨傘微微笑，準備好走出家門。",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/weather-clothes/7.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "218151719f3790b80c29ee3f2ec5702c67fa9cb2c8837f6ced36566aa9ffba97",
